#etcsl#altGrpc

@(A.222 = 222-227) …… approached. …… caused damage (?) ……. …… turned toward @wSN{Ereš}. …… the @wWN{Euphrates} …… the river of the gods. She made her way to the city whose destiny was decreed by @wDN{An} and @wDN{Enlil} ……. Wise Woman @wPN{Saŋburu} …… hand …… for him.

@(A.228 = 228-231) Both of them threw fish spawn (?) into the river. The sorcerer made a giant carp  @varh[t1824.v15]{come out } @vart[t1824.v16,t1824.v15]{@varn{1 ms. has instead:} arise } from the water. Wise Woman @wPN{Saŋburu}, however, made an eagle  @varh[t1824.v17]{come out } @vart[t1824.v18,t1824.v17]{@varn{1 ms. has instead:} arise } from the water.  @varh[t1824.v19]{The eagle seized the giant carp and fled to the mountains } @vart[t1824.v20,t1824.v19]{@varn{1 ms. has instead:} The eagle seized the giant carp out of the waves and went up to the sky }.

