@(A.232 = 232-235) A second time they threw fish spawn (?) into the river. The sorcerer made a ewe and its lamb  @varh[t1824.v21]{come out } @vart[t1824.v22,t1824.v21]{@varn{1 ms. has instead:} arise } from the water. Wise Woman @wPN{Saŋburu}, however, made a wolf  @varh[t1824.v23]{come out } @vart[t1824.v24,t1824.v23]{@varn{1 ms. has instead:} arise } from the water. The wolf seized the ewe and its lamb and dragged them to the wide desert.

