@(A.240 = 240-243) A fourth time they threw fish spawn (?) into the river. The sorcerer made an ibex and a wild sheep  @varh[t1824.v31]{come out } @vart[t1824.v32,t1824.v31]{@varn{1 ms. has instead:} arise } from the water. Wise Woman @wPN{Saŋburu}, however, made a mountain leopard  @varh[t1824.v33]{come out } @vart[t1824.v34,t1824.v33]{@varn{1 ms. has instead:} arise } from the water. The leopard seized the ibex and the wild sheep and took them to the mountains.

