@(A.244 = 244-248) A fifth time they threw fish spawn (?) into the river. The sorcerer made a gazelle kid come out from the water. Wise Woman @wPN{Saŋburu}, however, made a tiger and a …… lion come out from the water. The tiger and the …… lion seized the gazelle kid and  @varh[t1824.v35]{took } @vart[t1824.v36,t1824.v35]{@varn{1 ms. has instead:} dragged } them to the forest. What happened made the face of the sorcerer darken, made his mind confused.

